      "id": "2067526280069644749",
      "text": "FABLE 5 COMPLETELY CHANGES THE GAME OF VIDEO CONTENT CREATION\n\na guy gave the model a task, went to the gym, and came back to a finished video\n\nall thanks to the /goal command\non the new model from anthropic - claude fable 5\nyou set the task, and the model works autonomously until it gets it done\n\nand all of this without a single editing program:\n> whisper transcribed every take and added timestamps\n> fable picked the best parts itself, reading the transcript\n> ffmpeg cut and stitched everything by timestamp\n> subtitles and all the motion graphics built straight in code\n> at the end the model rendered frames and checked its own work\n\nnot a single traditional editor:\n— premiere\n— davinci\n— capcut\n\nwhat takes an editor a whole day took one hour\n\nthis is how content creation is going to look from now on",
